-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1209206#post1209206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From minute 56</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you kindly","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12220-dark-lord-potato","name":"Dark Lord Potato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T21:13:49-07:00","id":1209503,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1209097#post1209097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I\u2019m not sure the Cuban Middle Crisis has enough corruption. We did nearly wipe ourselves out, but that was more due to brinksmanship</div> </div> </div> </div> It's might not be corruption as in politicians for sale, although it might include that, but a corruption of general morality, so instead of the corruption by greed of a politician on the take, it could be a corruption of the elites on the level of pride or fear, the context of the Cuban Missle crisis corrupting their sense of reasonable responses, so that they potenientally respond in ways that could lead to nuclear war and the destruction of humanity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid"