 Contagion to become False?</div> </div> </div> </div>Curiosity would drive many of the opponents to become False,the need to Understand,to Know. That need drives many prometheans,vampires and and mages. There's also the hunger for revenge,if someone hurts you,getting revenge on them by finding a way to infect they ,or better yet ,someone they love with the Contagion would drive them to be False Some Sin-Eatears are Vengeful,Demons and Deviants as well","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T16:51:45-07:00","id":1210682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1210649#post1210649\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Give it a little while and I may throw something up in the blog or mention it in an upcoming podcast. There has to be something to anticipate <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Consider that there are three False groups. What kind of things would drive opponents of Contagion to become False?</div> </div> </div> </div>Twisted Banes. Sure the Contagion can mess with your powers, but it can also twist your weaknesses. Anyone messing with it may destroy the very benefits you are dealing by accident. If they do, you may never be able to restore the Contagion to have the effect it does. The Huntsman will return to full strength, the sun will burn and Infrastructure will function again. The only way to work in certainty is to ensure no one messes with the balance. If the Contagion spreads, that only increases the zone of potential safety. The mysteries of these changes should be handled delicately, preserved until they are not mysterious; only then should one begin to try to manipulate it. Preferably in isolation from the 'safe zone'.<br /> <br /> So it must be spread. Let the gift be shared.<br /> <br /> Edit: And so a group of Sworn have now converted to Falsehood.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T18:06:03-07:00","id":1210710,"title":"","content":"Thankyou for all the answers, Gentleman Gamer...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T18:08:24-07:00","id":1210712,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quot