"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As much as word count permits.</div> </div> </div> </div>There are a lot of things to cover with just the base splats from the gamelines. I will understand (though I will be <i>disappointed</i>) if you don't get there.<br /> <br /> Please don't try to shoe horn in a couple of paragraphs if you could expand on the interactions/intersections of the main groups. I'd rather wait in hopes of a Contagion supplement than risk the foundation of the 'cosmological' crossovers.<br /> <br /> (*Tries not to cry at the reminder that there is no Werewolf/Changeling era and his will be the closest we see*)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":1624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","user":"FallenEco","date":". 04-29-2018, 01:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-28T16:52:29-07:00","id":1212838,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1212710#post1212710\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Awesome! what part of the interview, time-wise?</div> </div> </div> </div> I have no idea, wasn't looking. Honestly the whole thing interesting to listen to the whole thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-28T21:37:38-07:00","id":1212929,"title":"","content":"I don't know enough about the Contagion to claim any expertise but given what I have heard so far I see three reasons why groups might embrace and accept it:<br /> <br /> 1-The Contagion is a just punishment, be it divine retribution, nature striking back or just our own sins coming home to roost, we deserve what we get.<br /> <br /> \u200b2-They believe they can weaponized it and in the battle against their enemies the ends always justify the means.<br /> <br /> \u200b3-They don't believe the Contagion is a punishment or really even bad, it is a crucible and those who survive it will be better and stronger for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-29T04:01:45-07:00","id":1212992,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1212828#post1212828\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There are a lot of things to cover with just the base splats from the gamelines. I will understand (though I will be <i>disappointed</i>) if you don't get there.<br /> <br /> Please don't try to shoe horn in a couple of paragraphs if you could expand on the interactions/intersections of the main groups. I'd rather wait in hopes of a Contagion supplement than risk the foundation of the 'cosmological' crossovers.<br /> <br /> (*Tries not to cry at the reminder that there is no Werewolf/Changeling era and his will be the closest we see*)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> My thinking as well. I'd rather dedicate the space they deserve to Immortals, Innocents, etc. in a sourcebook than giving them a cursory mention in the core.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:"