<div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1213839#post1213839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder which False groups,if any, would have strix as member. since they are so inimical to humanity</div> </div> </div> </div>Attempting to weaponize the breakdown of communication mentioned in the first podcast seems like it would fit as a goal for some. Keeping people from being able to voice their concerns and gathered lore about the strix, as well as tearing away at the foundations of the covenants and encouraging more lashing out and reliance on the Beast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T12:10:17-07:00","id":1213853,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1213850#post1213850\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Attempting to weaponize the breakdown of communication mentioned in the first podcast seems like it would fit as a goal for some. Keeping people from being able to voice their concerns and gathered lore about the strix, as well as tearing away at the foundations of the covenants and encouraging more lashing out and reliance on the Beast.</div> </div> </div> </div>indeed. now that I'm thinking of it,they could also be part of the Cryptocracy. They are the group obsessed with control,and no one is better at mind control than the strix","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T12:57:40-07:00","id":1213867,"title":"","content":"I must say that it is kinda weird that the strix are treated as the &quot;Pure/Seer&quot; parallel for Vampire instead of VII or Belial's Brood, while no one says anything about the idigam or insatiables choosing factions. I kind of wonder if the strix would suddenly become playable in some form- while I don't have any opinion about the subject, it could be interesting, I think.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T13:03:32-07:00","id":1213868,"title":"","content":"The strix at least seem to have some sort of consensus, even if there are renegades (the strix strix hunter, for instance). But the VII seem more like a 'you can make them whatever you want' in second edition, and Belial's Brood seems to have been for the most part ignored (hopefully we'll get some Evil evil with the Bale Hounds in werewolf). I imagine it would be easier to convert vampires into some near-strix state (like the pijavica but darkness and possession instead of blood-slime and torpor) rather than play as a hateful cloud of smoke.<br /> <br /> It's hard to imagine idigam having any sort of organization beyond 'they are at the top of everything around them.'<br /> <br /> Insatiables do seem like they should have some sort of grouping, though, I suppose they're rare and territorial enough that it's harder to justify.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T15:05:43-07:00","id":1213908,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1213867#post1213867\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I must say that it is kinda weird that the strix are treated as the &amp;quot;Pure/Seer&amp;quot; parallel for Vampire instead of VII or Belial's Brood, while no one says anything about the idigam or insatiables choosing factions. I kind of wonder if the strix would suddenly become playable in some form- while I don't have any opinion about the subject, it could be interesting, I think.</div> </div> </div> </div> Perhaps in Spilled Blood, they are going to have rules lost clans, bloodlines, and other types of vampires and Strix are a form of none Kindred Vampire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T12:55:16-07:00","id":1214274,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1213715#post1213715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Maybe there wasn't a lot of stuff requiring red lines.</div> </div> </div> </div>Usual amount of redlines, but I do this full-time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T13:13:07-07:00","id":1214282,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1213868#post1213868\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The strix at least seem to have some sort of consensus, even if there are renegades (the strix strix hunter, for instance). But the VII seem more like a 'you can make them whatever you want' in second edition, and Belial's Brood seems to have been for the most part ignored (hopefully we'll get some Evil evil with the Bale Hounds in werewolf). I imagine it would be easier to convert vampires into some near-strix state (like the pijavica but darkness and possession instead of blood-slime and torpor) rather than play as a hateful cloud of smoke.<br /> <br /> It's hard to imagine idigam having any sort of organization beyond 'they are at the top of everything around them.'<br /> <br /> Insatiables do seem like they should have some sort of grouping, though, I suppose they're rare and territorial enough that it's harder to justify.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> There's nothing stopping Strix joining the Cryptocracy, or indeed the VII or Belial's Brood vampires doing the same, though I would wager Belial's Brood is so caught up in their own philosophy, they'd have little interest in the Sworn or False.<br /> <br /> I suspect the Bale Hounds would willingly make themselves Contagious and piss off both the Sworn and False. Idigam.. Again, likely too alien to really give two shits. The new form of Forsaken antagonist though, introduced in both Contagion and Shunned by the Moon? They will tie to Contagion.<br /> <br /> Insatiables are definitely present in this book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],