 /> <br /> Goddammit Dataweaver.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-14T21:18:19-07:00","id":1218797,"title":"","content":"Better than what I was thinking-namely I was wonder who was shipping Kamduis-Ur with asides from Anpu.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-14T22:25:23-07:00","id":1218808,"title":"","content":"I dunno, I like the idea of a Sworn group coming up with an unconventional weapon to fight the Contagion...a weapon that takes the form of a giant garden gnome.<br /> <br /> They'll never see it coming!!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-14T22:51:33-07:00","id":1218813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1218276#post1218276\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>MattDawkins</b> talked in Pathcast how they written False as PLAYABLE splats, just like some groups and players want to be able play Pure, Bale Hounds, Seers or similar 'main gameline antagonists'. He also pointed that even normal, 'good side' groups join False - so in those groups are also Forsaken werewolves, Diamond Orders mages or Seasonal Courts changelings. In the end, he simply said that line between 'good guys' and 'bad guys' is very blurred in Sworn and False dichotomy. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I can easily see the Seers joining the Sworn as well some of the Pure. Heck the one Sworn write up we have fits the Seers like a glove and I can easily see the Ivories being on board as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T01:45:52-07:00","id":1220469,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1218590#post1218590\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm getting the impression from the Podcasts where contagion is mentioned,that damn near anyone could become part of a Sworn or False group. Any of the splats,minor and major. But also strix,idigam,Tremere,pandorans,huntsmen ,slashers,reapers etc.... Seems like anyone and anything can join a group and have access to Vectors if the group will have them. Is that correct?</div> </div> </div> </div>That is correct. As <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24222-acopiltaczet\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24222_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24222\" data-vbnamecard=\"24222\">Acopiltaczet</a> says however, some creatures (like Huntsmen) are going to be far less inclined and definitely be temporary members at best.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T01:46:55-07:00","id":1220470,"title":"","content":"As we progress nicely along with final drafts, I'll answer a few questions you're dying to ask about the Contagion Chronicle. Shoot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T02:54:33-07:00","id":1220479,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1220470#post1220470\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As we progress nicely along with final drafts, I'll answer a few questions you're dying to ask about the Contagion Chronicle. Shoot.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks Matthew!! I've been eager to ask the name of the fifth Sworn group (thus far we have the Cryptocracy, the Jeremiad, The Ship of Theseus, &amp; the Rosetta Society). and which would you join?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T03:09:38-07:00","id":1220484,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1220470#post1220470\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As we progress nicely along with final drafts, I'll answer a few questions you're dying to ask about the Contagion Chronicle. Shoot.</div> </div> </div> </div>ammm if I may...<br /> <br /> a) would there any new playable/antagonist template/splat which is directly connected to the Contagion? Like, could you play a Hurt Locker's Infect which were created by the Contagion?<br /> <br /> b) we know that the Contagion effects supernatural beings, but how it influence the mortal world? I mean, we know that at least one Faction believes its origin is from human actions (the Cryptocracy's Social Entropy theory), but how do mortal society influenced by those outbreaks?<br /> <br /> c) are there attempts to create a vaccine against the Contagion, and how successful were they through the years? While I assume that eliminating the Contagion is out of option, are there things which offer a measure of protection from it, or perhaps even allow to heal those infected by it? I expect Cheiron to work on such a thing, for example.<br /> <br /> d) what is your favorite Faction, and how easy would it be to create new Factions (Sworn/False/Something else? After all, you mentioned that some groups may have their own attitude toward the Contagion which does not align with either the Sworn or False, like Belial's Brood or the Bale Hounds).<br /> <br /> e) would we see &quot;guest appearances&quot; from old favorite NPCs? Like the Unholy, Zagerus, the Nameless, Theleme, Dr Brine, Blind Man, Unwashed Issac, etc?<br /> <br /> f) how similar are different outbreaks of the Contagion? I mean, are there always the same symptoms, or that for someone without any knowledge about the subject two outbreaks would look like two very different occult infections? Are there &quot;Contagion strains&quot;, with it evolving through time and each creates different symptoms or twist the occult world in different ways?<br /> <br /> g) If a different occult disaster would strike the planet (like, say, an alien/Void Leviathan invasion or the equivalent of a supernatural earthquake), as in the level of something which would force different monsters to band together in a similar fashion to the Contagion, would the Sworn/False division and methods of operation when dealing the crises would be more or less the same, or are there cases in which a different &quot;Sworn/False&quot; division would form? (so the question is, in fact, how strongly tied is the Sworn/False division to the Contagion itself, and how much it is tied to the group's ideology and world view. I mean, would Naglfar's Army would be considered allies in a case of the awakening of an elder god, with them willing to sacrifice their life while fighting the beast, while some other Sworn group would turn out supporting the beast in an attempt to study/worship it?)<br /> <br /> That's what I have right now. Feel free to ignore those questions which you would not like to answer right now :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":503,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","user":"LostLight","date":". 05-20-2018, 10:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T05:11:00-07:00","id":1220511,"title":"","content":"Thank you very much for the generosity. Now if it's okay.<br /> <br /> 1) how big of a powerup are Vectors? What can you get with them that you couldn't get with a splats main powers(Disciplines, Arcana, Exploits and Embeds that sort of thing)<br /> <br /> 2) does the contagion pose a serious threat to all splats, will some be more invested to others, and are those who just see it as an inconvienence.<br /> <br /> 3) in your opinion what do you think is the biggest difficulty you guys had in writing this with the intent of it being a crossover chronicle.<br /> <br /> 4) but also. What do you think is the biggest excitement of working on this as a crossover chronicle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":3742,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","user":"Iceblade44","date":".  Fucking auto correct 05-20-2018, 10:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T05:23:27-07:00","id":1220516,"title":"","content":"What crossover interactions between splats rules and how they work are there?<br /> And how much rules not pertaining to a outside threat is it?<br /> <br /> Or to put it like this, how much &quot;Contagion&quot; and how much &quot;Crossover&quot; is it in this book?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/523-poseur","name":"Poseur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"375"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T05:47:11-07:00","id":1220522,"title":"","content":"Will we get advice on a way for Indomitable to interact with awakened magic? :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T07:34:38-07:00","id":1220536,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1220470#post1220470\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As we progress nicely along with final drafts, I'll answer a few questions you're dying to ask about the Contagion Chronicle. Shoot.</div> </div> </div> </div>All right,thanks Gentleman.<br /> <br /> 1)How powerful can Vectors get,i mean can i use the Authority Vector to build me an army for instance?<br /> <br /> 2)I did some research on the Naglfar from Norse Myth,apparently,their army is made of dishonorable dead. Is the Naglfar's Army's Vector related to dishonor or to death?<br /> <br /> 3)You mentioned the Contagion can make a Werewolf change forms without control,and make a Vampire's vessel taste like battery acid,what does the contagion does to Changelings?<br /> <br /> 4)Is Malkavia,the disease version from the Chronicles of darknesss of the Malkavians from the One world of darkness related to the Contagion in any way?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T07:46:10-07:00","id":1220538,"title":"","content":"I have always been a fan of the cool powers. so,can i get a rundown of each vector if you please?<br /> <br /> will the book give advice on how to create new splats?<br /> <br /> What groups are the ones deviants choose to join,and how do they deal with the rage DaveB mentined enough to work in a group?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24222-acopiltaczet","name":"Acopiltaczet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24222_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T13:44:14-07:00","id":1220615,"title":"","content":"Ah here again but as your taking questions this just hit me so I wanted to ask.<br /> <br /> As the contagion is corrupting supernatural powers. Has the God-machine's Infrastructure been effected by it and has it sent angels into sworn or false groups to deal with it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T02:18:47-07:00","id":1220761,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1220479#post1220479\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks Matthew!! I've been eager to ask the name of the fifth Sworn group (thus far we have the Cryptocracy, the Jeremiad, The Ship of Theseus, &amp; the Rosetta Society). and which would you join?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The fifth Sworn group is named Zero Hour. It might give some indication as to their attitude. I'd join the Rosetta Society because I love Pontypool.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T02:32:56-07:00","id":1220763,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1220484#post1220484\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ammm if I may...<br /> <br /> a) would there any new playable/antagonist template/splat which is directly connected to the Contagion? Like, could you play a Hurt Locker's Infect which were created by the Contagion?<br /> <br /> b) we know that the Contagion effects supernatural beings, but how it influence the mortal world? I mean, we know that at least one Faction believes its origin is from human actions (the Cryptocracy's Social Entropy theory), but how do mortal society influenced by those outbreaks?<br /> <br /> c) are there attempts to create a vaccine against the Contagion, and how successful were they through the years? While I assume that eliminating the Contagion is out of option, are there things which offer a measure of protection from it, or perhaps even allow to heal those infected by it? I expect Cheiron to work on such a thing, for example.<br /> <br /> d) what is your favorite Faction, and how easy would it be to create new Factions (Sworn/False/Something else? After all, you mentioned that some groups may have their own attitude toward the Contagion which does not align with either the Sworn or False, like Belial's Brood or the Bale Hounds).<br /> <br /> e) would we see &quot;guest appearances&quot; from old favorite NPCs? Like the Unholy, Zagerus, the Nameless, Theleme, Dr Brine, Blind Man, Unwashed Issac, etc?<br /> <br /> f) how similar are different outbreaks of the Contagion? I mean, are there always the same symptoms, or that for someone without any knowledge about the subject two outbreaks would look like two very different occult infections? Are there &quot;Contagion strains&quot;, with it evolving through time and each creates different symptoms or twist the occult world in different ways?<br /> <br /> g) If a different occult disaster would strike the planet (like, say, an alien/Void Leviathan invasion or the equivalent of a supernatural earthquake), as in the level of something which would force different monsters to band together in a similar fashion to the Contagion, would the Sworn/False division and methods of operation when dealing the crises would be more or less the same, or are there cases in which a different &quot;Sworn/False&quot; division would form? (so the question is, in fact, how strongly tied is the Sworn/False division to the Contagion itself, and how much it is tied to the group's ideology and world view. I mean, would Naglfar's Army would be considered allies in a case of the awakening of an elder god, with them willing to sacrifice their life while fighting the beast, while some other Sworn group would turn out supporting the beast in an attempt to study/worship it?)<br /> <br /> That's what I have right now. Feel free to ignore those questions which you would not like to answer right now :P</div> </div> </div> </div>a) That's an interesting question. One of the chapters introduces a Contagion-specific entity (unlike a Contagious vampire or Contagious werewolf). There's no reason an Infected from Hurt Locker couldn't be one such creature, or the alternative, as a mortal (or whatever) infected with Contagion. If that makes sense. As for the pure Contagious as playable? Not immediately.<br /> <br /> b) Contagion affects the mortal world as well, but mortals (unless they're hunters or otherwise connected to the supernatural) are unlikely to see it as an interdimensional plague so much as &quot;a crippling swathe of depression afflicting Odense,&quot; to take one example. <br /> <br /> c) There are ways to prevent Contagion, and of course, each of the Sworn believe they have the best solution. <br /> <br /> d) My favourite faction is either the Rosetta Society (on the Sworn side) or Machiavelli Gambit (on the False side). It would be very easy to create others, and something I would be considering if we ever explored Contagion in a Dark Era or through companion books.<br /> <br /> e) At least two of those characters have made an appearance as of first drafts.<br /> <br /> f) Contagion's symptoms vary across location, depending on the cause or the carrier. Calling different types of Contagion its different strains would be accurate.<br /> <br /> g) If a different catastrophe were to occur, falling in with the Sworn or False as you would against Contagion would have a certain logic to it, though some of the factions are more focused on Contagion above all else. Would the factions switch around at all between Sworn and False? In the example where an elder god awakens, the Crucible Initiative (of the False) would likely fall in with the Sworn. The Machiavelli Gambit could swing one way or the other. I imagine Naglfar's Army would throw arms down and become cultists...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T02:45:25-07:00","id":1220765,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iceblade44</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1220511#post1220511\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you very much for the generosity. Now if it's okay.<br /> <br /> 1) how big of a powerup are Vectors? What can you get with them that you couldn't get with a splats main powers(Disciplines, Arcana, Exploits and Embeds that sort of thing)<br /> <br /> 2) does the contagion pose a serious threat to all splats, will some be more invested to others, and are those who just see it as an inconvienence.<br /> <br /> 3) in your opinion what do you think is the biggest difficulty you guys had in writing this with the intent of it being a crossover chronicle.<br /> <br /> 4) but also. What do you think is the biggest excitement of working on this as a crossover chronicle.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> 1) They're a solid power-up, but they work best if you're in a group containing other members of the same faction. The advantage you get from them is in many ways a collaborative one.<br /> <br /> 2) All splats should have cause for concern / reasons to want to use Contagion to their advantage.<br /> <br /> 3) None of them, really. We have access to all the existing 2e material (including books currently being written).<br /> <br /> 4) There's undoubtedly going to be a lot of pressure to get this right. I know we won't please everyone, but as long as we please some players and Storytellers and provide some new chronicle ideas, we've done our job.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T02:46:32-07:00","id":1220766,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Poseur</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1220516#post1220516\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What crossover interactions between splats rules and how they work are there?<br /> And how much rules not pertaining to a outside threat is it?<br /> <br /> Or to put it like this, how much &quot;Contagion&quot; and how much &quot;Crossover&quot; is it in this book?</div> </div> </div> </div>Contagion is the headline reason for crossover in this book, but there's a whole chapter dedicated to running crossover.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T02:48:13-07:00","id":1220767,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1220522#post1220522\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Will we get advice on a way for Indomitable to interact with awakened magic? :P</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Probably not. We will see.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T02:51:15-07:00","id":1220768,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1220536#post1220536\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> All right,thanks Gentleman.<br /> <br /> 1)How powerful can Vectors get,i mean can i use the Authority Vector to build me an army for instance?<br /> <br /> 2)I did some research on the Naglfar from Norse Myth,apparently,their army is made of dishonorable dead. Is the Naglfar's Army's Vector related to dishonor or to death?<br /> <br /> 3)You mentioned the Contagion can make a Werewolf change forms without control,and make a Vampire's vessel taste like battery acid,what does the contagion does to Changelings?<br /> <br /> 4)Is Malkavia,the disease version from the Chronicles of darknesss of the Malkavians from the One world of darkness related to the Contagion in any way?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> 1) Possible, though I believe the fifth level of Authority is more about changing mass ideas and perceptions.<br /> <br /> 2) A little bit of both.<br /> <br /> 3) You'll have to wait and see. We have a chapter where Changeling gets the Contagious focus.<br /> <br /> 4) Not unless you want it to be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T03:05:02-07:00","id":1220770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acopiltaczet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1220538#post1220538\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have always been a fan of the cool powers. so,can i get a rundown of each vector if you please?<br /> <br /> will the book give advice on how to create new splats?<br /> <br /> What groups are the ones deviants choose to join,and how do they deal with the rage DaveB mentined enough to work in a group?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Vectors: Not yet. I'll save that for a blog post.<br /> <br /> Splats: Not at this time. There are eight splats, which should be plenty outside any companion books.<br /> <br /> Deviants: They can join any of the factions, though we see Zero Hour as the most likely Sworn group to house them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T03:05:50-07:00","id":1220771,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iceblade44</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1220615#post1220615\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah here again but as your taking questions this just hit me so I wanted to ask.<br /> <br /> As the contagion is corrupting supernatural powers. Has the God-machine's Infrastructure been effected by it and has it sent angels into sworn or false groups to deal with it?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes, Infrastructure collapsing / becoming corrupted / failing to work is often how Contagion is first identified. Angels are present in some Sworn and False groups.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T03:33:56-07:00","id":1220776,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1220771#post1220771\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Yes, Infrastructure collapsing / becoming corrupted / failing to work is often how Contagion is first identified. Angels are present in some Sworn and False groups.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks Matthew, I love just seeing the possibilities of how you can take this contagion. This should be very fun","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/m