lineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T08:58:48-07:00","id":1220856,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1220854#post1220854\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, according to my question, they would be ones to fight an &quot;elder god awakening&quot; and stop it. Whatever it may actually mean I'm not sure- but it is something to ponder about :P<br /> <br /> And yeah, thank you Matthew! We really do appreciate that you took the time for this! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Matthew is amazing indeed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T11:03:31-07:00","id":1220879,"title":"","content":"Is Contagion understood by Humans as a catastrophe or is it subtle like the creatures that fight it?<br /> <br /> Can modifications survive the purge of outbreaks?<br /> <br /> Anything from books can be contaminated by it?<br /> <br /> Does Contagion escape the understanding and even the reality of all the Templetes?<br /> <br /> Can it be caused by something alien that crosses?<br /> <br /> The book dialogues thematically with some lovecraftian themes, as something incomprehensible and chaotic that crosses bringing the chaos with you? Something outside the balance of forces that influence humans? Something openly catastrophic and that only what is beyond the mundand can confront it? Something that brings hybridity to the polluted?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T11:56:43-07:00","id":1220895,"title":"","content":"How compatible will the crossover rules from Contagion Chronicles be with crossover rules from Dark Eras 2?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T11:59:49-07:00","id":1220896,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1220765#post1220765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They're a solid power-up, but they work best if you're in a group containing other members of the same faction. The advantage you get from them is in many ways a collaborative one.</div> </div> </div> </div>Followup questions:<br /> <br /> 1) From a mechanical standpoint, how does the cost-benefit of Vectors stack up to some of the more versatile and powerful options available to certain splats? Is buying up a Vector going to realistically compete with XP spent for the versatility granted by a dot of Arcana, or the raw power of an Exploit?<br /> (if they don't cost XP, this isn't actually a concern)<br /> <br /> 2) Are Vectors 'universal'? That is to say, does a Vampire with a given level of Authority and a Beast with the same level have access to identical abilities because of it?<br /> <br /> Not a question, but: I was kind of really on the fence about this Chronicle when I first heard it would be focused on the Contagion and not just be a generic Crossover guide. But everything I've heard about the Contagion itself so far is super compelling, and I'm glad to see what you've done with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3570,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","user":"lnodiv","date":". 05-21-2018, 03:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T13:29:07-07:00","id":1220926,"title":"","content":"Can we get any idea of how much crossover guideline materials we are getting that are NOT Contagion Chronicle related.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T14:30:15-07:00","id":1220943,"title":"","content":"Time for the boring but important question: Is \u201cWhat happens when I Mage Sight at the Contagion\u201d going to get, if not a definite answer, then at least enough attention that STs will feel confident they aren\u2019t giving Awakened players too much or too little information?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T14:32:23-07:00","id":1220946,"title":"","content":"Are the Geryo going to be appearing in it, or is it a Shunned by the Moon only thing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","u