30339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1221153#post1221153\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So,do you guys already have ideas about how to use Contagion in your chronicles? I think if i find an ST i'll play in a good old fashioned battle of Sworn vs False</div> </div> </div> </div>Large-scale, multi-generational Dark Eras chronicle.<br /> <br /> Where Eras are about different outbreaks of the Contagion, both in the PCs trying to stop the outbreaks, and then trying to prepare the next generations (aka later Eras) so they can be ready to fight them.<br /> <br /> For instance, the Contagion somehow being involved in the disappearance of the Roanoke Colony in Foreboding Lands with the local Sin-Eaters trying to figure out what's going on...flash-forward to years later at Salem in Doubting Souls and the hysteria that comes from the witch trials and a cell of the local hunters discovering it might be linked to someone bringing back someTHING supposedly connected to Roanoke...<br /> <br /> That kind of thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-22T13:39:04-07:00","id":1221244,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-dar