have a particular slant to one of the splats (for instance one location would have a heavy Vampire presence, another Promethean-focused, another Demon, etc). Which also means that there will be a Condition/Tilt in each location that's themed around the dominant splat.</div> </div> </div> </div>Vampire, Werewolf, Mage, Promethean. Changeling, Hunter, Geist, Demon, Mummy, Beast, Deviant = 11. What's the twelfth going to be themed on, I wonder?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-02T13:59:15-07:00","id":1224228,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SunlessNick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1224227#post1224227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Vampire, Werewolf, Mage, Promethean. Changeling, Hunter, Geist, Demon, Mummy, Beast, Deviant = 11. What's the twelfth going to be themed on, I wonder?</div> </div> </div> </div>You forgot Chronicles of Darkness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> o