> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T08:39:37-08:00","id":1278601,"title":"","content":"do you remember the supernatural template called the infected? they were also called carriers with an odd supernatural disease. are the infected actually victims of the contagion","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T10:20:17-08:00","id":1278622,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1278601#post1278601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">do you remember the supernatural template called the infected? they were also called carriers with an odd supernatural disease. are the infected actually victims of the contagion</div> </div> </div> </div>I asked a similar question earlier and the answer I got was that a Contagion based Infected would be &quot;interesting&quot;- so I don't think they are going to be connected by default.<br /> <br /> EDIT: just to give the exact question and answer-<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Q</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">a) would there any new playable/antagonist template/splat which is directly connected to the Contagion? Like, could you play a Hurt Locker's Infect which were created by the Contagion?</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>A</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">a) That's an interesting question. One of the chapters introduces a Contagion-specific entity (unlike a Contagious vampire or Contagious werewolf). There's no reason an Infected from Hurt Locker couldn't be one such creature, or the alternative, as a mortal (or whatever) infected with Contagion. If that makes sense. As for the pure Contagious as playable? Not immediately.</div> </div> </div> </div>So the Carriers (as I assume they are the creatures which were referred to in the answer) are not the Infected, even though they may cover some common territory. The way I'll put it, Carriers are for antagonists, while the Infected could be used for protagonists. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":503,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","user":"LostLight","date":". 01-04-2019, 03:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T11:44:21-08:00","id":1278653,"title":"","content":"hmm, ok. I'm gonna see it as open to interpretation","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T20:25:18-08:00","id":1278754,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1278559#post1278559\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll get to your questions soon, but a new piece of information for you:<br /> <br /> Creatures of pure Contagion are known as Carriers.<br /> <br /> They're not nice.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hm. If the Contagion is an Anti-God-Machine, is there an Unchained equivalent for Carriers?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T21:43:35-08:00","id":1278768,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1278754#post1278754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hm. If the Contagion is an Anti-God-Machine, is there an Unchained equivalent for Carriers?</div> </div> </div> </div>I would not make the assumption that it is an Anti-God-Machine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T21:51:51-08:00","id":1278770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1278768#post1278768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would not make the assumption that it is an Anti-God-Machine.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fortunately, nobody here is doing that!<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1130339-contagion-chronicle-book?p=1276220#post1276220\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Contagion comes in many variations, but can best be described as the Anti-God-Machine or Anti-Infrastructure, if you're DC Comics-inclined.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T22:03:36-08:00","id":1278771,"title":"","content":"Gentleman Gamer may be referencing the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anti-Monitor\" target=\"_blank\">Anti-Monitor</a>, a sort of sucking, antagonistic and entropic force on the universe, as opposed to the God Machine, or Infrastructure's attempts to stabilize things. A wyrm to the weaver.<br /> <br /> Maybe they're going with a direct comparison with Carriers to Angels and something to Demons, but the Contagion seems more opportunistic than organized. That said, Angels and Demons seem capable of being in Sworn or False (the Cryptocrats seemed to have formed with the help of Unchained, and the Crucible Initiative with an angel, for instance).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-05T00:22:01-08:00","id":1278778,"title":"","content":"I got the impression that the Contagion messes with the occult physics Infrastructure runs on to the degree it breaks it down if not outright subborns it. Which is more akin to the God-Machine being allergic to the Contagion than anything more direct.<br /> <br /> Not that the differences huge, mind you. The God-Machine doesn't appear to exist outside of the Infrastructure that makes it up, so the Contagion would basically be a disease that kills it for which it's natural antibodies (cults, secrecy, angels) are unable to defend it for the most part.<br /> <br /> The issue I have with the direct &quot;Anti-God-Machine&quot; statement is simple; it would basically become the Creator of Hell if it were so directly oppositional, (basically making 90% of the Unchained join the False once known). Carrier may resemble Angels (in so far that they 'serve' the Contagion), but should also deviate so drastically that they should also resemble the Infected or a Ghoul. Given the clear inspiration from viral outbreaks, the idea of a 'fallen carried does seem to gel. Heck, I doubt there will be clear evidence that the Contagion is anymore sentient than a Firestorm","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-05T02:16:01-08:00","id":1278794,"title":"","content":"I can see what you mean. It would be quite a downer (to me at least) for the contagion to basically be the opposite of the GM, way less variety","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-05T09:23:45-08:00","id":1278829,"title":"","content":"There are plans for after that book. Appearing on others with other threats in common that bring together all templetes?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/641-ben-linus","name":"Ben Linus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-18T14:08:33-08:00","id":1281575,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/episode-35-new-year-new-plan/\" target=\"_blank\">Interesting.</a> Looks like Contagion is going to have some settings in it similar to the core books, but with more pages (one on every continent, including Antarctica), each with a different kind of Contagion presence. One example was that mortals linked to supernaturals would hit a depressive and potentially suicidal streak. Kyoto is where the Geryo are introduced, and Geryo is based on Geryon. So it'll have 'a whole slew of campaign settings that are detailed remarkably well...and plenty to do and play with.'<br /> <br /> Also the abilities of the Sworn and maybe the False groups are dependent on what supernaturals are represented in the group, so you get more abilities out of a group with Vampire, Werewolf, Mage, and so forth, rather than all Vampires, though it looks like you can still have an all Vampire group. Got a bit of a Beast Nightmare vibe from that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 01-18-2019, 05:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-28T20:50:00-08:00","id":1283423,"title":"","content":"Appro