 pretty amazing in and of itself!<br /> Quick question for The Gentleman Gamer: will the Contagion Chronicle game you all made characters for be recorded and put on the OnyxPath Youtube channel, or is there a separate site we can listen to the chronicle's story?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not Matthew, but my understanding when he ran the idea by all of us was that the entire game will be hosted on the channel - character creation was just the first session.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-11T20:34:12-07:00","id":1296025,"title":"","content":"I really like the Pure character concept! I hope all the players have fun with their characters!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-11T21:22:06-07:00","id":1296034,"title":"","content":"Now that CC has been confirmed as the next Kickstarter, I'm in for at least the PDF, we will see what else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"